llama.cpp / ggml (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp)

Portions of UNLTD Inference are implemented from llama.cpp / ggml's
MIT-licensed algorithms and observable behavior: the GPT-2 / Qwen
byte-level BPE tokenizer splitter logic and its byte-level regex
patterns, the scalar quantized dequantization and dot-product kernels
(Q4_K, Q6_K, Q8_0), and the Qwen3.5 forward structure validated
against it. No source code was copied from llama.cpp / ggml; these
portions are independent Rust implementations that follow the
reference algorithms.

